# demo.tape
Output demo.gif

Set FontSize 13
Set Width 800
Set Height 550
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set FontFamily "JetBrains Mono"

Type "shelfplayer"
Enter
Sleep 1s

# browse the shelf
Down
Sleep 500ms
Down
Sleep 500ms
Up
Sleep 500ms

# load a tape
Enter
Sleep 800ms

# play it
Enter
Sleep 5s

Type "n"
Sleep 6s

# done
